flowchart LR
    U[Usuario] --> CF[Cloudflare DNS y HTTPS]
    CF --> S3[Amazon S3<br/>React + Vite]
    S3 --> APIGW[Amazon API Gateway]
    APIGW --> L[AWS Lambda<br/>API REST stateless]
    L --> DDB[Amazon DynamoDB]
    L --> CW[Amazon CloudWatch]
    SAM[AWS SAM<br/>Infraestructura como código] --> APIGW
    SAM --> L
    SAM --> DDB
